Description: Offensive Flow Executor - Red Team Automation Tool
 OFX is a comprehensive toolkit for red team operations including
 exploitation, post-exploitation, enumeration utilities, and
 webshell management.
 .
 Features:
  - Post-exploitation runners (SSH, WebShell, WinRM, SMBExec, WMIExec)
  - Webshell generators and clients
  - Enumeration tools (LinPEAS, WinPEAS integration)
  - HTTP server utilities
  - Search and reconnaissance tools
